  message: "Merged in PR #1441 (dev b130f1c054).\n\nFixed in PR #1441. http, graphql, graphql_sdl, graphql_resolver, database_query, event_sourcing, message_queue, grpc, ipc, websocket, solidity_abi and di_resolution read `taxonomy.extension_globs/extension_suffixes(*JS_TS_LANGUAGES)` (di_resolution reads `\"typescript\"`), and each one's dispatch accepts every suffix.\n- Behaviour, per extension (`test_js_ts_extension_single_source.py`): every finder discovers all 8 suffixes. `link_message_queues`, `link_http` and `link_grpc` mint a node per suffix carrying the analyzer's tag. solidity_abi scans all 8. di_resolution binds in `.ts/.tsx/.mts/.cts`. `.mts/.cts` comments are now masked.\n- Fixture survey: database-query, event-sourcing and message-queue nodes went from `.js/.ts` only to all 8 extensions; http from 4 to 8.\n- Corpus: apollo-server +14 nodes / +11 edges, all in smoke-test `.mjs/.cjs/.mts/.cts` (13 real, 1 false positive filed as WI-fihah). growthbook +4 nodes / +18 edges in `.tsx` (17 real, 1 template-literal false positive noted on WI-filup).\n- Gate: no linker module may hold a private JS/TS extension list (AST scan with a mutation control).\n- Other languages' private lists are filed as WI-midik; non-linker core lists as WI-sunub."  # 5386
